This project includes no copied third-party source code, but parts of its design
derive from the following projects:

1. obra/superpowers (MIT License)
   Methodology distillation: skill-authoring discipline and workflow patterns were
   studied and re-expressed for MIDAS. No code copied.

2. wshobson/agents (MIT License)
   Agent persona structure and role definitions adapted for MIDAS agent profiles.

3. anthropics/skills (Apache License 2.0 subset)
   Skill-format conventions (SKILL.md frontmatter, resource-directory layout
   scripts/references/assets/agents, progressive-disclosure practice) follow the
   conventions of the Apache-2.0-licensed skills in that repository. The
   proprietary document skills in that repository (docx, pdf, pptx, xlsx —
   "all rights reserved") are explicitly excluded: nothing in MIDAS is derived
   from their contents.

4. BMAD-METHOD
   MIDAS has design ancestry in the BMAD method; see the BMAD repository for its
   license terms. No BMAD code is bundled here.
